body:
@seanmonstar - I pushed the change for `clearing pending_send` + `buffered_send_data` to a branch: https://github.com/DarrenTsung/h2/commit/6ee879630febb1b0a186054fbdc169e5db251e99 because I'm having some issues with `pop_frame()` getting called with streams that are reset and therefore don't have any frames to pop. 

The only exception is apparently scheduled reset streams, hitting this `expect("must be scheduled to reset")` (https://github.com/DarrenTsung/h2/blob/clear-send-buffer-on-remote-reset/src/proto/streams/prioritize.rs#L659).

Do you know why the connection is expecting the stream closed by remote reset to pop_frame?

